WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.278
The Apollo space missions sent people to the Moon.
阿波罗任务把人送到了月球。

2
00:00:05.278 --> 00:00:12.812
NASA ran these flights in the 1960s and early 1970s.
NASA在1960年代和1970年代初执行这些飞行。

3
00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:17.082
They were part of the space race.
它们是太空竞赛的一部分。

4
00:00:17.082 --> 00:00:23.032
Apollo 7 was the first successful Apollo flight.
阿波罗7号是第一次成功的阿波罗飞行。

5
00:00:23.032 --> 00:00:29.030
It tested the ship in Earth orbit in 1968.
它在1968年在地球轨道上测试飞船。

6
00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:35.028
Apollo 11 made history in 1969.
阿波罗11号在1969年创造了历史。

7
00:00:35.028 --> 00:00:40.810
Neil Armstrong and Buzz Aldrin walked on the Moon.
尼尔·阿姆斯特朗和巴兹·奥尔德林在月球上行走。

8
00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:46.592
Armstrong said it was one giant leap for mankind.
阿姆斯特朗说，这对人类是一次巨大飞跃。

9
00:00:46.592 --> 00:00:51.966
Apollo 13 had a big problem in space.
阿波罗13号在太空中出了大问题。

10
00:00:51.966 --> 00:00:59.932
The crew came home safely. People call it a successful failure.
机组安全回家。人们称它为成功的失败。

11
00:00:59.932 --> 00:01:06.074
Apollo 17 was the last mission to land on the Moon.
阿波罗17号是最后一次登月任务。

12
00:01:06.074 --> 00:01:11.712
Twelve people walked on the Moon in the Apollo years.
阿波罗年代共有12人走过月球。

13
00:01:11.712 --> 00:01:17.854
Today, NASA plans for people to travel there again.
今天，NASA计划让人们再次前往月球。
